The file each role resolved to -- the mod&apos;s own, or the one its fallback download
lands. A filter may need ANOTHER role&apos;s texture: repacking a material mask asks the
DIFFUSE under each texel how flesh-coloured it is, because a code in the matte band is
skin only there
</verbatim> </para>
